This is an island settlement game where you are a custom country (not a real one) in a huge custom world map with a bunch of other countries and you can declare war make allies with other countries ask for money and land. The goal is to be the highest on the leader board!

⚠️Notice⚠️
Please report any bugs because it could affect every server.
To report bugs either do it in issues or in the game in the settings where you to click feedback and you can report ideas, bugs, other.
